ファルシ、クシャレワー学院で学んでいる。","nextNodeIds":[230300113]},{"nodeId":230300113,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":12688,"speakerName":"ラドプ","textMapHash":663827754,"text":"僕はラドプ、スパンタマッド学院の学生だ。","nextNodeIds":[230300114]},{"nodeId":230300114,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":12689,"speakerName":"ファルシ","textMapHash":1940082066,"text":"旅人、俺たちもお前に手伝ってほしいことがあるんだ。","nextNodeIds":[230300115]},{"nodeId":230300115,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":12689,"speakerName":"ファルシ","textMapHash":4126565522,"text":"ヤスミンが最近、この「聖樹」の根の周りに薬を撒いているのは知っているな？","nextNodeIds":[230300116]},{"nodeId":230300116,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":12689,"speakerName":"ファルシ","textMapHash":1577648194,"text":"しかし…その…最近ヤスミンが撒いた薬には問題があったようなんだ…","nextNodeIds":[230300117]},{"nodeId":230300117,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":12689,"speakerName":"ファルシ","textMapHash":2714890010,"text":"彼女が薬を撒いた地域の周りには、様々な魔物が出現するようになるんだよ。","nextNodeIds":[230300118]},{"nodeId":230300118,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":12688,"speakerName":"ラドプ","textMapHash":1224903178,"text":"僕は誓って、絶対に薬の処方や投薬の配分を変えていない。きっと…うん、何か予想外のことが起きたんだ。","nextNodeIds":[230300119]},{"nodeId":230300119,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":12689,"speakerName":"ファルシ","textMapHash":2793851242,"text":"そうは言うけどなあ…とにかく旅人、一緒にヤスミンが薬を撒いた場所を見に行ってくれないか。","nextNodeIds":[230300120]},{"nodeId":230300120,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":12689,"speakerName":"ファルシ","textMapHash":19460922,"text":"例によって大量の魔物が出現しているかもしれないんだが、俺たちだけでは行く勇気がないんだ…力のあるやつに同行してほしい。","nextNodeIds":[230300121]},{"nodeId":230300121,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":12688,"speakerName":"ラドプ","textMapHash":3062755434,"text":"もっと重要なのは、たとえキノコンにはあまり危険性がないとしても、教官が僕たちの薬に問題があることを知れば…","nextNodeIds":[230300122]},{"nodeId":230300122,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":12689,"speakerName":"ファルシ","textMapHash":2287491978,"text":"俺たちの論文の研究計画書は突っ返されるに決まってる…","nextNodeIds":[230300123]},{"nodeId":230300123,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":12688,"speakerName":"ラドプ","textMapHash":3489600010,"text":"特に僕のスパンタマッド学院は、提出したデータに誤りがあった場合、先生から厳しく叱責されるんだ。","nextNodeIds":[230300124,230300125]},{"nodeId":230300124,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1838518218,"text":"分かった。","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":230300125,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1597476202,"text":"今までどうやって問題を解決してたの？","nextNodeIds":[230300126]},{"nodeId":230300126,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":12689,"speakerName":"ファルシ","textMapHash":2144545490,"text":"基本は自分たちで冒険者を雇うか、教官のところに行って、教官の名前で信用できるエルマイト旅団のメンバーを探すんだ。","nextNodeIds":[230300127]},{"nodeId":230300127,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":12689,"speakerName":"ファルシ","textMapHash":1908044306,"text":"だが、教官の堪忍袋の緒も限界でね。今の状況じゃ、わざわざ会いに行く勇気はないなあ…","nextNodeIds":[230300128]},{"nodeId":230300128,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":12688,"speakerName":"ラドプ","textMapHash":185254130,"text":"だから、きみにお願いするしかないんだ！旅人さん！","nextNodeIds":[]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[2303001,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_SCENE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_TARGET","LNHLPKELCAL":["12688"],"NOCCOBOFKHP":3,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_NONE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_NPC"}}},{"subQuestId":2303007,"order":2,"stepDescription":"ラドプに同行する","stepDescTextMapHash":3268822708,"finishConds":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[2303007,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_FINISH_PLOT","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_SCENE","GGJOHCAJAPP"